<main>
<section class="hero lead-hero3">
  <img src="/img/chalet/megeve-n0-apt-sejour.jpg" alt="" width="1600" height="964" fetchpriority="high">
  <div class="lead3-texte">
    <p class="fil lead-fil"><a href="/fr/">Accueil</a> / <a href="/fr/kosher-chalets/">Nos chalets casher</a> / Le chalet du Mont Blanc, près de Megève</p>
    <div class="lead3-bloc"><!--KIT-WP:hero--><div class="kwp-hero-wp"><img src="/img/wp-long-or-powered.svg" alt="Winter Prestige, Powered by Mishpacha Tours" width="1222" height="430"></div><!--/KIT-WP:hero-->
    <h1>Le chalet du Mont Blanc, près de Megève<br><i>10 chambres twin, sauna et jacuzzi face au Mont Blanc</i></h1>
    <p>Un grand chalet dans la vallée du Mont Blanc, à quelques minutes de Megève, pensé pour accueillir plusieurs familles à la fois.</p>
    <a class="btn-hero" href="https://wa.me/33652092301?text=Hello%2C%20we%20would%20like%20the%20kosher%20chalet%20near%20Meg%C3%A8ve.%20Dates%3A%20/%20Number%20of%20families%3A" rel="noopener"><svg><use href="#wa"/></svg>Organiser mon séjour sur WhatsApp</a>
    </div><!-- _lead_retouches.py (15/10) met le formulaire en bouton principal et WhatsApp en lien : à relancer après ce script -->
  </div>
</section>

<section class="ss wrap lead-intro"><img class="lead-mascotte" src="/img/picto-hassid-vert.svg" alt="" width="797" height="806" loading="lazy"><div><p>Ten twin bedrooms, two attic rooms and an adjoining apartment with its own front door. A sauna and a jacuzzi facing Mont Blanc, a shuttle at the foot of the chalet every twenty minutes to the lifts. Our team koshers the kitchen, a chef cooks or kosher meals are delivered, and Shabbat comes with a minyan on request. One request, one written quote.</p></div></section>

<section class="ss wrap conseils"><h2>The chalet, <i>in short</i></h2><ul class="dk-cartes dk-rail">
<li><img class="dk dk-ico dk-des" src="/img/des/chef-hat.webp" alt="" width="96" height="96" loading="lazy"><b>Ground floor.</b> A lounge with a bar, one dining room for everyone, the kitchen we kosher, a ski room, and one twin bedroom at ground level.</li>
<li><img class="dk dk-ico dk-des" src="/img/des/house.webp" alt="" width="96" height="96" loading="lazy"><b>The apartment.</b> Adjoining the chalet, with its own front door: a living room, its own kitchen, one twin bedroom and one bunk bedroom. Ideal for a family that wants its own space.</li>
<li><img class="dk dk-ico dk-des" src="/img/des/plane.webp" alt="" width="96" height="96" loading="lazy"><b>First floor.</b> Seven twin bedrooms, each with its own shower room, around a wide landing that opens onto a terrace.</li>
<li><img class="dk dk-ico dk-des" src="/img/des/check.webp" alt="" width="96" height="96" loading="lazy"><b>Under the roof.</b> Two attic rooms, for the teenagers or the staff.</li>
<li><img class="dk dk-ico dk-des" src="/img/des/badge-check.webp" alt="" width="96" height="96" loading="lazy"><b>Wellness.</b> A sauna and a jacuzzi facing Mont Blanc.</li>
<li><img class="dk dk-ico dk-des" src="/img/des/car.webp" alt="" width="96" height="96" loading="lazy"><b>Getting to the slopes.</b> A shuttle stops at the foot of the chalet every twenty minutes; the lifts are six to eight minutes away.</li>
<li><img class="dk dk-ico dk-des" src="/img/des/utensils.webp" alt="" width="96" height="96" loading="lazy"><b>Kitchen.</b> Kashered by our team before you arrive, included. A chef cooks in the chalet, or kosher meals arrive ready to reheat.</li>
</ul>
<p>Every bedroom has twin beds, so each family arranges its beds as it needs. Availability is confirmed for your dates with each request.</p></section><div class="ss beige dk-recit"><div class="wrap"><h2>Shabbat <i>in the chalet</i></h2><p><img class="dk dk-ico dk-ico-recit dk-des" src="/img/des/flame.webp" alt="" width="96" height="96" loading="lazy">The chef prepares the Shabbat meals and the holidays in the chalet, or the meals arrive before candle lighting. For a minyan, we bring the bochurim and a Sefer Torah: with the men of your group, Shacharis takes place in your living room.</p>
<p>Strictly kosher, everything served is Chalav Yisrael. The supervision details come in writing with your quote.</p></div></div><section class="ss wrap etapes"><h2>How it <i>works</i></h2><ol><li><b>1</b><div><h3>Tell us</h3><p>Your dates, the number of families and what you want. By WhatsApp or with the form at the bottom of this page. Hebrew-speaking guests are welcome.</p></div></li><li><b>2</b><div><h3>We check the chalet</h3><p>Our team in the Alps confirms the chalet for your dates, then the chef, the transfers and the minyan.</p></div></li><li><b>3</b><div><h3>You get one programme</h3><p>A day-by-day programme and one written quote for the whole stay, before you commit to anything.</p></div></li></ol></section><div class="wrap cta-etapes"><p class="cta-hero centre"><a class="btn-noir" href="https://wa.me/33652092301?text=Hello%2C%20we%20would%20like%20the%20kosher%20chalet%20near%20Meg%C3%A8ve.%20Dates%3A%20/%20Number%20of%20families%3A" rel="noopener"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#wa"/></svg>Ask on WhatsApp</a><a class="pill" href="#book">Get a quote</a></p></div><div class="ss beige"><div class="wrap"><h2>Getting <i>there</i></h2><ul class="dk-cartes">
<li><img class="dk dk-ico dk-des" src="/img/des/plane.webp" alt="" width="96" height="96" loading="lazy"><b>From Geneva airport.</b> About 1 h 15 by road. Lyon-Saint-Exupéry, about 2 h 15.</li>
<li><img class="dk dk-ico dk-des" src="/img/des/car.webp" alt="" width="96" height="96" loading="lazy"><b>Transfers.</b> Vans with car seats from the airport to the chalet and back, on quote.</li>
<li class="dk-lien1"><img class="dk dk-ico dk-des" src="/img/des/plane-landing.webp" alt="" width="96" height="96" loading="lazy"><b>Land in Lyon with a few hours to spare?</b> <a href="/fr/tours/stopover/">The Stopover</a>: a private 3 hour tour of Jewish Lyon between the plane and the road.</li>
</ul></div></div><section class="ss wrap faq"><h2>The Mont Blanc Chalet: <i>questions</i></h2><details><summary>How much does it cost?</summary><p>The price depends on your dates, the number of people and the services you choose. You receive a written quote before you commit to anything.</p></details><details><summary>How many people can stay?</summary><p>Ten twin bedrooms and two attic rooms, plus the apartment: three or four families under one roof, each with its own bedrooms.</p></details><details><summary>Is the apartment separate?</summary><p>It adjoins the chalet and has its own front door, living room and kitchen. One family can have it to itself.</p></details><details><summary>Who cooks the meals?</summary><p>A chef cooks kosher meals in the chalet, or ready meals are delivered. Our team kashers the kitchen before you arrive.</p></details><details><summary>Is there a minyan?</summary><p>We bring the bochurim and a Sefer Torah to the chalet for Shabbat, on request. Tell us your dates early.</p></details><details><summary>How do we get to the slopes?</summary><p>A shuttle stops at the foot of the chalet every twenty minutes; the lifts are six to eight minutes away.</p></details></section><!--KIT-WP:bandeau--><section class="ss wrap kwp kwp-seul-bandeau"><div class="kwp-bandeau"><img src="/img/wp-long-or-powered.svg" alt="Winter Prestige, Powered by Mishpacha Tours" width="1222" height="430" loading="lazy"></div></section><!--/KIT-WP:bandeau-->
<!--KIT-WP:mini--><section class="ss wrap kwp kwp-mini"><h2>Un chalet rien que pour vous ? <i>Quatre chalets casher</i></h2><div class="kwp-mini-v kwp-trois"><a class="kwp-v" href="/fr/kosher-chalet-les-deux-alpes/"><img src="/img/chalet/wp-ext-bleu.jpg" alt="" width="160" height="107" loading="lazy"><span><b>Les Deux Alpes</b>6 + 1 chambres · à 2 min des pistes</span></a><a class="kwp-v" href="/fr/kosher-slope-chalet-les-deux-alpes/"><img src="/img/chalet/slope-facade.jpg" alt="" width="160" height="107" loading="lazy"><span><b>Les Deux Alpes · chalet des pistes</b>6 chambres · skis aux pieds</span></a><a class="kwp-v" href="/fr/kosher-chalet-courchevel/"><img src="/img/chalet/courchevel-ext.jpg" alt="" width="160" height="107" loading="lazy"><span><b>Courchevel</b>5 suites · piscines chauffées</span></a></div><p class="kwp-tous"><a class="pill" href="/fr/kosher-chalets/">Voir les quatre chalets</a></p></section><!--/KIT-WP:mini-->
